        <object id="notes" label="&lt;b&gt;Gaps (not drawn):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Not drawn: a page classified non-medical at 90% or more, where the customer keeps or discards it (flows.md §Gate rules).&lt;br&gt;• Not drawn: a medical page at 90% or more, which goes straight to extraction without triage.&lt;br&gt;• Not drawn: the Compare view&amp;#x27;s second verdict run and the eval runner&amp;#x27;s runs (AD-11, AD-17).&lt;br&gt;• Not drawn: failure paths. A stage that misses its 180-second deadline stores a failed result (AD-6); what the user sees is not stated.&lt;br&gt;• Not drawn: a redaction that fails or passes its deadline. The case ends as failed and the customer uploads again (AD-21).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each element's source is in grey under its name and in its tooltip.">
          <mxCell style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;fillColor=#FAFAFA;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="20" y="1397.4" width="1970" height="166.1" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
